        "@value": "Classic Albums Live Performs: Pink Floyd - Dark Side of the Moon - Confederation Centre of the Arts"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The East Coast Production Group is thrilled to announce that on February 12/2026 the band, Classic Albums Live will perform Pink Floyd’s “Dark Side of the Moon” album, note for note, cut for cut! The event promises an unforgettable night of rock and roll perfection. Doors will open at 7:00 PM with the Classic Albums Live band, taking the stage at 8:00 PM. About Classic Albums Live | Pink Floyd Performance: Twenty million people bought this album first on vinyl, then cassette, then cd then one day it was on our phones. We’ve lived a life alongside this album. Dark Side of the Moon came out in 1973 it was everywhere. The album cover prism was drawn on countless school binders. We started paying attention to the sound of cash registers, having a good stereo system was a thing. Classic Albums Live knows how to perform this album, it’s complex and full of soul. Just getting the alarm clocks together was a feat. All the little voices, then you had to find someone that could sing ‘great gig in the sky’. We did, and it’s joyous. The musicians care about this album; it was our flagship show in 2003. It’s […]"
      }
    ],
