    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Rock Orchestra by Candlelight"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "After entertaining over 700,000 fans across the UK, USA, and Europe, The Rock Orchestra by Candlelight is launching its first major tour across Canada — and it’s a concert experience like no other. In a 90-minute live show, 14 classical musicians bring a haunting beauty to iconic rock and metal anthems, all set in an atmospheric candlelit setting. Showtimes:Two performances only — 5:30 PM and 8:30 PM. Expect the UnexpectedThis is a powerful blend of classical music and metal, where elegant string arrangements meet walls of distortion, creating a sound that’s both enchanting and electrifying. Featuring music from legendary bands: Metallica AC/DC Rage Against The Machine My Chemical Romance Linkin Park System of a Down Guns N&#8217; Roses Evanescence Aerosmith The Cranberries…and more. What Our Fans Are Saying: “Every rock fan should see and hear this concert!” “F**king awesome would not do it justice!” “Entertaining from the first song to the last.” “Perfect blend of classical bravado and hard rock!” “The music, the show, the stage… something incredible!” Important Notes: The Rock Orchestra by Candlelight is a rotating group of professional classical musicians and vocalists. This performance is not affiliated with the original artists or composers. All trademarks are the [&hellip;]"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/keywords": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Music, On Stage"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
