        "@value": "PD Day Musical Theatre Intensive Camp"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Join us for a full-day Musical Theatre workshop designed to build skills in storytelling, audition technique, Musical Theatre Jazz Dance, and Improvisation. Workshop Classes • Storytelling Through Voice &amp; Movement with Julian Molnar • How to Audition: Musical Theatre Jazz Dance with Kristen Pottle • Improvisation with Cameron MacDonald Schedule 10:00–11:30 AM Storytelling Through Voice &amp; Movement with Julian Molnar 11:30 AM–12:00 PM Lunch / Break (AK cover) 12:00–1:45 PM How to Audition: Musical Theatre Jazz Dance with Kristen Pottle 2:00–3:30 PM Improvisation with Cameron MacDonald"
      }
    ],
