    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "No agenda, just great conversations, new connections, and meeting fellow artists and arts workers. Arts Mixers at Confederation Centre Thursday, March  24th Mavor’s Lounge | 4:00–6:00 PM Come raise a glass, swap stories, and reconnect with your arts, culture and creative industries community. No agenda—just great conversations, new connections, and the chance to meet fellow artists and arts workers Register here."
